1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,997
Form validation checks what the user typed before it is sent.

2
00:00:03,997 --> 00:00:11,093
The form's onsubmit calls a function; returning false cancels the submission, returning true lets it go.

3
00:00:11,093 --> 00:00:14,947
The browser check is for convenience: instant feedback.

4
00:00:14,947 --> 00:00:20,559
But users can switch JavaScript off, so the server must check again before anything is saved.

